# What EAS Build leaves out of the upload. Having this file means EAS no longer reads .gitignore, so the
# .gitignore rules that matter are repeated here.

# Local tooling and private working files: large and not part of the app
**/.claude/
/video/
/absorbed-brain/
HANDOFF-TM.md
brag-output*/
usekelmi.com/
/marketing/
/docs/
/apps/mobile/marketing/
/apps/mobile/legal/
/apps/mobile/docs/

# Dependencies and build output (EAS installs its own)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# The native projects are generated in the cloud from app.json
apps/mobile/ios/
apps/mobile/android/

# Secrets and signing files never go up (public keys are set as EAS environment variables)
**/.env
**/.env*.local
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.jks
**/*.mobileprovision

.DS_Store
